MODULE: QuiesceNeverAdmitsDuringSaturationQuiesceSkipped
TARGET: QuiesceNeverAdmitsDuringSaturation
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: A data prepare bypasses the cached saturation verdict.
PERTURBS: WriterOpportunity
--- FIND
    /\ (Prepare \/ Decide \/ WriterIdle)
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: data dispatch ignores saturation.
    /\ (Prepare \/ Decide \/ WriterIdle
        \/ (saga = "idle" /\ saga' = "prepared" /\ drained' = {}
            /\ checkpointed' = FALSE /\ completed' = FALSE /\ terminalWitness' = FALSE
            /\ UNCHANGED <<registryVersion, crossed>>))
--- END
